{"id":"fe3b669b17d273d8","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-skolem-expansion.md","title":"Skolem Expansion","display":"df-skolem-expansion — Skolem Expansion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-skolem-expansion","aliases":["17-df-skolem-expansion"],"display":"df-skolem-expansion — Skolem Expansion","depends_on":["[[17-df-term]]","[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-free-variable]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-bound-variable]]","[[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]","[[17-df-symbols]]","[[17-df-language-constants]]"],"source_section":"3.3","source_result":"Skolem-expansion definition preceding Proposition 3.3.1","source_pages_print":[163,164],"source_pages_djvu":[179,180],"source_verification":"definition and expansion proof compared in supplied OCR; local ordered-variable indexing and string-recursion variant","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-2.3.2","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-skolem-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-skolem-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-skolem-expansion — Skolem Expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1af1787ca7786a32\" href=\"?note=1af1787ca7786a32\" title=\"17-df-bound-variable\">17-df-bound-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a514469c2cfe1502\" href=\"?note=a514469c2cfe1502\" title=\"17-df-simultaneous-substitution\">17-df-simultaneous-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5772a390b9182440\" href=\"?note=5772a390b9182440\" title=\"17-df-language-constants\">17-df-language-constants</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Skolem-expansion definition preceding Proposition 3.3.1"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>163</span><span>164</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>179</span><span>180</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition and expansion proof compared in supplied OCR; local ordered-variable indexing and string-recursion variant"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-2.3.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Log}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Log}_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a> 的逻辑符号分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sk}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sk}\\)</span> 仅为以下扩张对象的形式上标标签。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is a first-order language with components from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>同时结构替换及其捕获自由谓词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a514469c2cfe1502\" href=\"?note=a514469c2cfe1502\" title=\"17-df-simultaneous-substitution\">17-df-simultaneous-substitution</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"1af1787ca7786a32\" href=\"?note=1af1787ca7786a32\" title=\"17-df-bound-variable\">17-df-bound-variable</a>。本模式在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;=L^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\">\\(L&#39;=L^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\)</span> 中使用这些递归；变量出现在替换项位置时先使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}\">\\(\\operatorname{lit}\\)</span> 提升。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{\\varphi,y}\">\\(c_{\\varphi,y}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}\">\\(f_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}\\)</span> 由下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Name}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Name}_L\\)</span> 构造，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"5772a390b9182440\" href=\"?note=5772a390b9182440\" title=\"17-df-language-constants\">17-df-language-constants</a>。它们是彼此不同且不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L\">\\(\\Sigma_L\\)</span> 中的符号；前者为常元，后者的正元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar x)\">\\(n=\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar x)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x,\\bar z\">\\(\\bar x,\\bar z\\)</span> are variable tuples, with components <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=\\bar x(i)\">\\(x_i=\\bar x(i)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_i=\\bar z(i)\">\\(z_i=\\bar z(i)\\)</span>. The domain of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)\">\\(w_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)\\)</span> consists of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L)\">\\(\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^n\">\\(\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^n\\)</span>. All other new symbols are defined below.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nc_{\\varphi,y}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Name}_L((0,\\langle\\varphi,y\\rangle)),\\\\\nf_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Name}_L((1,\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nc_{\\varphi,y}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Name}_L((0,\\langle\\varphi,y\\rangle)),\\\\\nf_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Name}_L((1,\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_n(L)\n={}&amp;\\{\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\land y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\n\\land\\bar x:n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(x_i=x_j\\to i=j)\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{y\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C(L)\n={}&amp;\\{c_{\\varphi,y}:\\langle\\varphi,y,\\varnothing\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_0(L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_0(L)\n={}&amp;\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal S_n(L)\n={}&amp;\\{f_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}:\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L)\\}\\qquad(0&lt;n&lt;\\omega),\\\\\nw_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)\n={}&amp;\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{lit}(c_{\\varphi,y}),&amp;n=0,\\\\\nf_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\operatorname{lit}(z_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})),&amp;0&lt;n&lt;\\omega,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nL^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\n={}&amp;\\left\\langle\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup\\mathcal C(L),\n(\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\cup\\mathcal S_n(L))_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\mathrm{Log}_L\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\n={}&amp;T\\cup\\Bigl\\{\n\\forall z_0\\cdots\\forall z_{n-1}\n\\Bigl((\\exists y\\,\\varphi)[\\operatorname{lit}(z_0)/x_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\varphi[w_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)/y,\\operatorname{lit}(z_0)/x_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]\\Bigr):\\\\\n&amp;n\\in\\omega,\\ \\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L),\\ \\bar z:n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\n\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(z_i=z_j\\to i=j),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar z)\\cap(\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_{L}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{y\\})=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_n(L)\n={}&amp;\\{\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\land y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\n\\land\\bar x:n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(x_i=x_j\\to i=j)\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{y\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C(L)\n={}&amp;\\{c_{\\varphi,y}:\\langle\\varphi,y,\\varnothing\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_0(L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_0(L)\n={}&amp;\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal S_n(L)\n={}&amp;\\{f_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}:\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L)\\}\\qquad(0&lt;n&lt;\\omega),\\\\\nw_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)\n={}&amp;\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{lit}(c_{\\varphi,y}),&amp;n=0,\\\\\nf_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\operatorname{lit}(z_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})),&amp;0&lt;n&lt;\\omega,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nL^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\n={}&amp;\\left\\langle\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup\\mathcal C(L),\n(\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\cup\\mathcal S_n(L))_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\mathrm{Log}_L\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\n={}&amp;T\\cup\\Bigl\\{\n\\forall z_0\\cdots\\forall z_{n-1}\n\\Bigl((\\exists y\\,\\varphi)[\\operatorname{lit}(z_0)/x_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\varphi[w_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)/y,\\operatorname{lit}(z_0)/x_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]\\Bigr):\\\\\n&amp;n\\in\\omega,\\ \\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L),\\ \\bar z:n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\n\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(z_i=z_j\\to i=j),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar z)\\cap(\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_{L}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{y\\})=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The ordered free-variable list fixes each new symbol's arity. Empty lists introduce constants. Fresh variable lists make the substitutions in this Skolem schema capture free. The general structural replacement operation does not rename bound variables and may capture free variables for other inputs. The operation deletes the entry for a bound variable when descending through its quantifier; replacement terms are inserted once and are not resubstituted. Structural recursion is well founded because each recursive call uses a shorter subterm or subformula. Bound-variable recursion and simultaneous substitution are supplied by the two local definition files named in Hypothesis.</p>\n<p>This is a local presentation of the Skolem expansion in Chang–Keisler §3.3, printed pp. 163–164, DjVu pages 179–180. The book indexes symbols by existential formulas; this presentation also records an ordering of their free variables. Proposition 3.3.1(i) constructs expansions by choosing witnesses and supplies the conservativity argument. The local label is not a book definition number.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-bound-variable","status":"resolved","id":"1af1787ca7786a32","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-bound-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-simultaneous-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"a514469c2cfe1502","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbols","status":"resolved","id":"3eb5325f08c84582","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbols]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-constants","status":"resolved","id":"5772a390b9182440","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-constants]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Log}_L$ 取 [[17-df-first-order-language]] 的逻辑符号分量；$\\mathrm{Sk}$ 仅为以下扩张对象的形式上标标签。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ is a first-order language with components from [[17-df-first-order-language]], and $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ as in [[17-df-sentence]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ is a first-order language with components from [[17-df-first-order-language]], and $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ as in [[17-df-sentence]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ and $\\mathrm{FreeVar}$ are from [[17-df-formula]] and [[17-df-free-variable]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ and $\\mathrm{FreeVar}$ are from [[17-df-formula]] and [[17-df-free-variable]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-simultaneous-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"a514469c2cfe1502","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"同时结构替换及其捕获自由谓词采用 [[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]；$\\mathrm{BV}_{L'}$ 采用 [[17-df-bound-variable]]。本模式在 $L'=L^{\\mathrm{Sk}}$ 中使用这些递归；变量出现在替换项位置时先使用 $\\operatorname{lit}$ 提升。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-bound-variable","status":"resolved","id":"1af1787ca7786a32","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"同时结构替换及其捕获自由谓词采用 [[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]；$\\mathrm{BV}_{L'}$ 采用 [[17-df-bound-variable]]。本模式在 $L'=L^{\\mathrm{Sk}}$ 中使用这些递归；变量出现在替换项位置时先使用 $\\operatorname{lit}$ 提升。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-constants","status":"resolved","id":"5772a390b9182440","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c_{\\varphi,y}$ 与 $f_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}$ 由下式的 $\\operatorname{Name}_L$ 构造，见 [[17-df-language-constants]]。它们是彼此不同且不在 $\\Sigma_L$ 中的符号；前者为常元，后者的正元数为 $n=\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar x)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Log}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sk}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BV}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"L'=L^{\\mathrm{Sk}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit}","display":false},{"tex":"c_{\\varphi,y}","display":false},{"tex":"f_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Name}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x,\\bar z","display":false},{"tex":"x_i=\\bar x(i)","display":false},{"tex":"z_i=\\bar z(i)","display":false},{"tex":"w_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nc_{\\varphi,y}&:=\\operatorname{Name}_L((0,\\langle\\varphi,y\\rangle)),\\\\\nf_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}&:=\\operatorname{Name}_L((1,\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_n(L)\n={}&\\{\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\land y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\n\\land\\bar x:n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_L\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j<n\\;(x_i=x_j\\to i=j)\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{y\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C(L)\n={}&\\{c_{\\varphi,y}:\\langle\\varphi,y,\\varnothing\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_0(L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S_0(L)\n={}&\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal S_n(L)\n={}&\\{f_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}:\\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L)\\}\\qquad(0<n<\\omega),\\\\\nw_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)\n={}&\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{lit}(c_{\\varphi,y}),&n=0,\\\\\nf_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\operatorname{lit}(z_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})),&0<n<\\omega,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nL^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\n={}&\\left\\langle\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup\\mathcal C(L),\n(\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\cup\\mathcal S_n(L))_{n\\in\\omega},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\mathrm{Log}_L\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nT^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\n={}&T\\cup\\Bigl\\{\n\\forall z_0\\cdots\\forall z_{n-1}\n\\Bigl((\\exists y\\,\\varphi)[\\operatorname{lit}(z_0)/x_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\varphi[w_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}(\\bar z)/y,\\operatorname{lit}(z_0)/x_0,\\ldots,\\operatorname{lit}(z_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]\\Bigr):\\\\\n&n\\in\\omega,\\ \\langle\\varphi,y,\\bar x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_n(L),\\ \\bar z:n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\n\\forall i,j<n\\;(z_i=z_j\\to i=j),\\\\\n&\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar z)\\cap(\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_{L}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{y\\})=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":5007,"backlinks":[{"id":"1427940d1339037e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T^{\\mathrm{Sk}}$ (Skolem expansion, see [[17-df-skolem-expansion]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-language-constants]]、[[17-df-skolem-expansion]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df